  m_text: 'The first rays of sunlight break through the darkness.


    As the sun
    rises, the trees begin to fade around you. Moments later, you find yourself standing
    alone in an empty field.


    The forest is gone, as if it had never existed.


    You
    survived the night.


    <align=center><size=60%>press space to continue</size></align>'
